      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mannes esne frigne mannan ofslæhð, þane þe sie hund scillinga gelde, se agend þone banan agefe ⁊ oþer manwyrð þær tó.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person’s servant kills a free man, who should be compensated for with a hundred shillings, the owner should give up that killer and another man-worth in addition.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mannes esne frigne mannan ofslæhð, þane þe sie hund scillinga gelde, se agend þone banan agefe ⁊ oþer manwyrð þær tó.</ab>
      </div>
